# Life (half of Life // Death): "All lands you control become 1/1 creatures until end of turn. They're still lands." The set of
# lands is fixed as it resolves (CR 611.2c): a Forest played afterwards is only a land, and Bot2's Island, which Bot1 does
# not control, is untouched. The Forest in play since turn 3 attacks as a creature (it has been under Bot1's control since
# the start of the turn) and deals 1, and the effect has ended by Bot1's next turn.

